<title>USA: Alabama jobless rate climbs to 5 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Alabama jobless rate climbs to 5 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alabama's unemployment rate rose to five percent in October from 4.7 percent in September, state labor officials said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Job losses were attributed to declines in textile manufaturing and in the federal government sector.</p>
<p>The October jobless rate was still below the national avera ge of 5.2 percent, and well below the 6.5 percent Alabama reported in October of last year.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
